GATE="jvm-test"
EXPECT_EXIT="3"
DESCRIPTION="The JVM build is removed entirely. The gate must report NOT APPLICABLE (exit 3) rather than error, because a repository with no build file is not a broken JVM project -- it is not a JVM project. Until this fault existed, exit 3 was the one code in the contract with the most prose and no proof, reachable only from shellcheck and never exercised."
